From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandru Ardelean <alex@shruggie.ro>
Date: Sat, 11 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] drop the tomlkit dependency

tomlkit is imported lazily by src/hatchling/cli/version/__init__.py and
is only reached by "hatchling version <new>", which rewrites a version in
pyproject.toml. The PEP 517 backend entry points never touch it, and the
feed packages hatchling only as a build backend, so the declared
dependency just blocks the host build.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OpenWrt packages the build backend only]

Signed-off-by: Alexandru Ardelean <alex@shruggie.ro>
---
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -38,7 +38,6 @@
   "packaging>=24.2",
   "pathspec>=0.10.1",
   "pluggy>=1.0.0",
-  "tomlkit>=0.11.1",
   "tomli>=1.2.2; python_version < '3.11'",
   "trove-classifiers",
 ]
